#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:10002
#: c1048cee86494c41b2330ab34da39875
msgid "Case Study: ML Preprocessing Pipeline"
msgstr "ケーススタディ: ML 前処理パイプライン"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:10004
#: 7e9f733577a74ebd96bfe8285e8963de
msgid ""
"The `MLPreprocessor` class provides a scikit-learn-style transformer API for"
" preprocessing gravitational-wave data for machine learning applications. It"
" implements the preprocessing pipeline used in DeepClean v2, including:"
msgstr ""
"`MLPreprocessor` クラスは、重力波データを機械学習向けに前処理するための scikit-learn スタイルの transformer "
"API を提供します。DeepClean v2 で使用されている前処理パイプラインを実装しており、以下の機能を含みます。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:10006
#: 6c0a245f97514f0b89e896508eb88405
msgid ""
"**Data splitting**: Time-ordered train/validation split with integer-second "
"alignment"
msgstr "**データ分割**: 整数秒アライメントによる時間順の訓練/検証分割"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:10007
#: c086c489b03542e19d58b3bb6c2af9e4
msgid ""
"**Bandpass filtering**: Butterworth filter with multiple frequency bands"
msgstr "**バンドパスフィルタリング**: 複数周波数帯域に対応した Butterworth フィルタ"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:10008
#: 1ba7113a6d3245cf97a56bf4c9e72e3a
msgid ""
"**Standardization**: Channel-wise normalization (Z-score or robust MAD-"
"based)"
msgstr "**標準化**: チャンネルごとの正規化（Z スコアまたはロバスト MAD ベース）"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:10010
#: 246d7f1282164d1a93d225698280679d
msgid ""
"This preprocessing is applicable to any machine learning model (DeepClean, "
"Random Forest, XGBoost, etc.), not just deep learning."
msgstr ""
"この前処理は、ディープラーニングに限らず、あらゆる機械学習モデル（DeepClean、Random Forest、XGBoost など）に適用できます。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:10012
#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:210017
#: 705edeffcb514633abd9558d4782f751 980e394d439f435299af04a3e9aa4f5a
msgid ""
"**Related API**: [Preprocessing API](../../reference/api/preprocessing.rst),"
" [Time Series API](../../reference/api/timeseries.rst)"
msgstr ""
"**関連 API**: [Preprocessing API](../../reference/api/preprocessing.rst), "
"[Time Series API](../../reference/api/timeseries.rst)"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:10013
#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:210018
#: 5e52c3358e7d4fd2b94b51f78eeeae0a ecd2407119cd44a899ed0295a30721b7
msgid ""
"**Related theory**: [Validated "
"Algorithms](../../explanation/validated_algorithms.md), [Numerical "
"Stability](../../explanation/numerical_stability.md)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:40002
#: b5bc4aae01764361889ebf6513c1dfb1
msgid "Basic Usage"
msgstr "基本的な使い方"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:40004
#: 6893ee51ea3e45a682d13242bc77f3eb
msgid ""
"Let's create some dummy data representing auxiliary (witness) channels and a"
" target strain channel."
msgstr "補助（ウィットネス）チャンネルとターゲットの strain チャンネルを表すダミーデータを作成しましょう。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:60002
#: 715dd8ac3bab452383b3a2759ff40a69
msgid "Preprocessing Pipeline"
msgstr "前処理パイプライン"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:60004
#: 1d0b2c14f593489b9136cb7f67498cda
msgid "The typical workflow is:"
msgstr "一般的なワークフローは以下のとおりです。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:60005
#: 1101842d404741c283416cad1022c1c4
msgid "**split()**: Divide data into train/validation sets"
msgstr "**split()**: データを訓練セットと検証セットに分割する"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:60006
#: 00670a7cac904be0be547c01c3874713
msgid "**fit()**: Learn statistics and filter coefficients from training data"
msgstr "**fit()**: 訓練データから統計量とフィルタ係数を学習する"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:60007
#: 73a34af1a8fe4f21859595f0caadb3b8
msgid "**transform()**: Apply preprocessing to train/validation data"
msgstr "**transform()**: 訓練/検証データに前処理を適用する"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:60009
#: cc7d221600fc49c7b9caef22e40d1074
msgid ""
"**Axis-order note:** in this notebook, witness inputs `X` stay in GWexpy's "
"channel-first order `(n_channels, 1, n_samples)`. Many ML libraries expect "
"batch-major tensors later, so transpose only at the dataset/model boundary "
"and keep the preprocessing steps in the original axis order."
msgstr ""
"**軸順序の注意:** このノートブックでは、ウィットネス入力 `X` は GWexpy の channel-first 順序 "
"`(n_channels, 1, n_samples)` のまま扱います。後段の ML ライブラリでは batch-major "
"テンソルを要求することがありますが、転置はデータセット化やモデル入力の境界でだけ行い、前処理中は元の軸順序を保ってください。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:90002
#: 2b1282c9f54a4177a22f393de89ae936
msgid "Data Splitting Visualization"
msgstr "データ分割の可視化"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:90004
#: d554f09df8bd499ea7f6ef28d42603b2
msgid ""
"The split is time-ordered (first portion for training, last for validation) "
"with integer-second alignment to match DeepClean v2 behavior."
msgstr "分割は時間順（前半が訓練用、後半が検証用）で行われ、DeepClean v2 の動作に合わせて整数秒でアライメントされます。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:110002
#: ff223a15353540f78d4ed53859ee7d97
msgid "Filtering and Standardization Effects"
msgstr "フィルタリングと標準化の効果"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:110004
#: fc2f547536a7462d948d4bcdb52c4bf8
msgid "**Important**:"
msgstr "**重要**:"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:110005
#: 669447b0d0fc4ea58e0bf5a4e8fbfa6f
msgid "**Witness channels (X)** are NOT filtered, only standardized"
msgstr "**ウィットネスチャンネル (X)** はフィルタリングされず、標準化のみが適用されます"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:110006
#: bb22f0dadb044a1e8257d20c89599306
msgid "**Target channel (y)** is filtered THEN standardized"
msgstr "**ターゲットチャンネル (y)** はフィルタリング後に標準化されます"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:110008
#: 04b3e7e1d6464be4ae7b0404e1ae0d2f
msgid "This follows DeepClean v2's processing order."
msgstr "これは DeepClean v2 の処理順序に従っています。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:130002
#: 27fb69f0f66a4a0c971a78e8f7fe38e0
msgid "Frequency Domain Analysis"
msgstr "周波数領域解析"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:150002
#: f170245f7a3a4ebdb3493d0863d694c6
msgid "PyTorch Integration"
msgstr "PyTorch 連携"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:150004
#: 5e4da89fd5984e96832f19d320677bcb
msgid ""
"The preprocessed data can be used with `TimeSeriesWindowDataset` for deep "
"learning models."
msgstr "前処理済みデータは、ディープラーニングモデル用に `TimeSeriesWindowDataset` と組み合わせて使用できます。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:170002
#: 3f78d4cd62e041839cfbd5340dc9e27b
msgid "Advanced Topics"
msgstr "発展的な話題"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:170004
#: 02471e65ecf442429d09eda959becc4a
msgid "Multiple Frequency Bands"
msgstr "複数の周波数帯域"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:170006
#: d772c62121f64a38910bbf2818ef7831
msgid ""
"You can filter multiple frequency bands simultaneously (results are summed)."
msgstr "複数の周波数帯域を同時にフィルタリングできます（結果は合算されます）。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:190002
#: 615be22f8e694cd4a05d84388f5763d3
msgid "Robust Standardization"
msgstr "ロバスト標準化"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:190004
#: 914b604621204404ac40e71ef482f7e2
msgid ""
"For data with outliers, use `robust` (MAD-based) standardization instead of "
"z-score."
msgstr "外れ値を含むデータに対しては、Z スコアの代わりに `robust`（MAD ベース）標準化を使用します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:210002
#: 6149dafc97c24c039bb5fcfe4178d586
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "まとめ"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:210004
#: 6c153276d1874fc08d6a1e2b9f4e2912
msgid "The `MLPreprocessor` provides:"
msgstr "`MLPreprocessor` は以下の機能を提供します。"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:210006
#: 1ef7906ad78f4b3c86be26d4bc01e3df
msgid "**Flexible preprocessing** for any ML model (not just DeepClean)"
msgstr "**柔軟な前処理**: あらゆる ML モデルに対応（DeepClean に限定されない）"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:210007
#: c447f06a587f49de9d4062a610c04093
msgid "**DeepClean v2 compatibility** with identical processing order"
msgstr "**DeepClean v2 互換**: 同一の処理順序を再現"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:210008
#: 40397e9953424498be85ac69670c23c1
msgid "**Easy integration** with PyTorch, scikit-learn, XGBoost, etc."
msgstr "**容易な統合**: PyTorch、scikit-learn、XGBoost などとの連携が容易"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:210009
#: e1a87a6ac1754b039242a156ab782e2f
msgid ""
"**Robust handling** of edge cases (single channel, outliers, zero variance)"
msgstr "**ロバストな処理**: エッジケース（単一チャンネル、外れ値、ゼロ分散）への対応"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:210011
#: 7ee2a3603aef46558463e6415ea3fa3c
msgid "**Key processing order**:"
msgstr "**処理順序のポイント**:"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:210012
#: f7b134cba99847a6a598b39c5fb435dc
msgid "Witness channels (X): Standardization only (no filtering)"
msgstr "ウィットネスチャンネル (X): 標準化のみ（フィルタリングなし）"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:210013
#: 14f9882103c34bffac594161ea0c95af
msgid "Target channel (y): Filtering → Standardization"
msgstr "ターゲットチャンネル (y): フィルタリング → 標準化"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_ml_preprocessing.ipynb:210015
#: 90b1dd338db942019a47c16fd9ac0ec6
msgid ""
"For more details, see the [API "
"documentation](../../reference/api/preprocessing.rst)."
msgstr "詳細は [API ドキュメント](../../reference/api/preprocessing.rst) を参照してください。"
